WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.935
Day one is a check, not a lesson.

2
00:00:02.385 --> 00:00:05.041
It shows you where your child is, and where to start.

3
00:00:05.741 --> 00:00:09.853
You hold the grown-up page. Your child gets the page with the big words.

4
00:00:10.303 --> 00:00:11.482
There are three parts.

5
00:00:11.932 --> 00:00:16.351
Part A. Six short words. These are the base. Mark each word read right.

6
00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:23.858
Part B. Eight words with two sounds side by side, at the end or at the start. Mark each word read right.

7
00:00:24.308 --> 00:00:30.583
Part C. Six harder words: more blends, and words with five sounds. Mark each word read right.

8
00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:37.630
Listen for one thing. If your child leaves a sound out, circle that word. That is the habit this plan works on.

9
00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:42.002
Do not teach, and do not correct today. Just listen and mark.

10
00:00:42.452 --> 00:00:47.694
Then read the box at the bottom of your page, from the top. Stop at the first line that fits.

11
00:00:48.144 --> 00:00:53.659
That line tells you where to start. It may be day two, or day six, or the story on day nine.

12
00:00:54.109 --> 00:01:00.375
One line is for the child who finds the short words hard. That child needs the blending plan first.

13
00:01:00.825 --> 00:01:05.503
Write the three numbers on the page, and keep it. You will look at it again on the last day.
